      "id": "0eb700202918",
      "name": "snapshot-GC + evolve.log\u6708\u5f52\u6863",
      "prompt": "\u6267\u884c\u4e24\u9879\u7ef4\u62a4\u4efb\u52a1:\n\n1. \u6e05\u7406 30 \u5929\u524d snapshot:\n   find ~/.hermes/snapshots -name \"pre_*\" -type d -mtime +30 -exec rm -rf {} + 2>/dev/null\n\n2. evolve.log \u6708\u5ea6\u5f52\u6863 (\u6bcf\u67081\u53f7):\n   \u5982\u679c\u4eca\u5929\u662f\u5f53\u67081\u53f7 (\u5468\u65e5\u4e5f\u8dd1):\n   if [ \"$(date +\\%d)\" = \"01\" ]; then\n     mv ~/.hermes/logs/evolve.log ~/.hermes/logs/evolve-$(date -d '1 month ago' +\\%Y\\%m).log\n     touch ~/.hermes/logs/evolve.log\n     echo \"Archived evolve.log\"\n   else\n     echo \"Not 1st of month, skip archive\"\n   fi\n\n\u8f93\u51fa: GC\u6e05\u7406\u4e86\u591a\u5c11\u3001\u662f\u5426\u5f52\u6863",
